chances by 4.5x",imageUrl:"/course/landing/chintan.png",product_type:n.BM},volatility:{product_id:"discretionary-course",text:"From learning how to Trade Volatility",imageUrl:"/course/landing/raghav.png",product_type:n.BM},algovol:{product_id:"algovol",text:"From learning how to Trade Volatility",imageUrl:"/landing/algovol.png",product_type:n._z},tradingcourse:{product_id:"murli-trading-course",text:"From turning market volatility into opportunity",imageUrl:"/course/landing/murli.png",product_type:n.nQ},"advanced-algo-trading-course":{product_id:"keshav-trading-course",text:"From transforming your trading strategy with automation!",imageUrl:"/course/landing/keshav.png",product_type:n.BM},"crypto-trading-course":{text:"From joining the premium Crypto Algo Community.",product_id:"crypto-trading-course",imageUrl:"/course/landing/ramneet.png",product_type:n._z},"99-special-offer":{text:"",product_id:"99-special-offer",imageUrl:"/course/landing/ra.png",product_type:n.BM},"199-special-offer":{text:"",product_id:"199-special-offer",imageUrl:"/course/landing/ra.png",product_type:n.BM},"mutual-fund":{product_id:"mutual-fund-course",text:"From joining our Lifetime Premium InvestHQ Community",imageUrl:"/course/landing/raghav.png",product_type:n.PV}},a={featuredCourse:[{_id:"chintan-algo-course",product_id:"algo-course",link_id:"algo",image:"/course/course-chintan.png",videoId:"clZrctNuZxI",videoLink:"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1094327828?title=0&byline=0&portrait=0&badge=0&autopause=0&player_id=0&app_id=58479&autoplay=1&muted=0",duration:"8-10 weeks",status:"Batch Starting Soon!",title:"Algo Trading Course: Learn Option Buying & Selling",description:"Institutions use Algo-Trading to trade quickly and efficiently. With AlgoTest, it is possible for you, a retail trader, to do the same. Learn our tried and tested process for Algo-Trading!",reminder:"Remember: Trading is a business, not gambling.",instructor:"Chintan Jaggi",features:e=>[{icon:"Users",text:"Exclusive Community"},{icon:"Code",text:`${e} Credits`},{icon:"Calendar",text:"Weekly Classes"},{icon:"GraduationCap",text:"Professional Algo Trading Course"}],curriculum:[{module:"Module 1",title:"Intro to Algo Trading",description:["Get an overview of algo trading, its core principles, and how automated strategies are designed, tested, and deployed in live markets."]},{module:"Module 2",title:"Understand the Core Mechanics of Backtesting",description:["Gain in-depth knowledge of how a backtester works, including the finer details of data handling, strategy evaluation, and performance analysis to ensure accurate and reliable results."]},{module:"Module 3",title:"Option Selling",description:["Directional Selling Strategies: Learn to identify option selling strategies based on the market's trend direction, allowing you to capitalize on price movements in a specific direction.","Non-Directional Selling Strategies: Master strategies that thrive in sideways or range-bound markets, where you sell options to benefit from time decay and stable volatility.","Momentum-Based Selling Strategies: Discover how to sell options in high-momentum environments, leveraging market acceleration to optimize premium collection and manage risks effectively."]},{module:"Module 4",title:"Option Buying",description:["Momentum-Based Buying Strategies: Learn to buy options in trending markets, capitalizing on strong momentum to profit from significant price moves.","Range Breakout Buying Strategies: Master the art of buying options when prices break out of key support or resistance levels, anticipating significant price movements following a consolidation period."]},{module:"Module 5",title:"Expiry Trading",description:["Learn specialized techniques to profit on expiry days, taking advantage of the time decay and volatility spikes as options approach expiration."]},{module:"Module 6",title:"Build Portfolios with Strategic Correlation",description:["Learn how to create diversified portfolios by selecting assets with optimal correlations, balancing risk and maximizing returns based on market conditions."]},{module:"Module 7",title:"Execution Settings",description:["Understand the crucial role of execution settings in trading success, where proper execution can significantly impact strategy performance, including slippage, order timing, and trade management."]}],faqs:[{question:"Can I learn options trading while working full-time?",answer:{summary:"Absolutely! Over 70% of our students are working professionals who successfully balance our options trading course for beginners with their careers. The program is designed for busy professionals with a flexible 3-4 hours per week commitment.","Perfect For Working Professionals":["Weekend live sessions (no weekday conflicts)","Self-paced video modules you can watch anytime","Community-driven schedule decided by members","All sessions recorded for lifetime access"],note:"This options trading course time commitment fits perfectly alongside your full-time job."}},{question:"How do I access live options trading sessions and calendar details?",answer:{summary:"Our online options trading course is 100% online, allowing you to learn from anywhere with internet access.","Easy Access Process":["Join our private trading community after enrollment","Get Zoom links 24 hours before each session","Access recordings within 2-4 hours of each live session"],note:"All joining details for live options trading sessions are available in the community dashboard."}},{question:"Is this options course suitable for both buyers and sellers?",answer:{summary:"Yes! Our comprehensive best options trading course covers both sides of options trading.","For Options Buyers":["Call and put buying strategies","Timing entries and exits","Risk management for premium buyers"],"For Options Sellers":["Premium collection strategies","Advanced selling strategies like iron condors"],note:"Whether you prefer buying or selling options, this course has you covered."}},{question:"Do I need to be an options trading expert to join?",answer:{summary:"No prior expertise required! This options trading course welcomes traders at all levels.","Minimum requirements":["Basic understanding of what options are (calls/puts)","Active trading account with options approval","Willingness to learn and practice strategies","3-4 hours per week for course material"],"We'll teach you everything else":["Advanced options strategies step-by-step","Risk management techniques","Market analysis for options trading","Psychology and discipline"],note:"Perfect for beginners who know options basics but want to master profitable strategies."}},{question:"Can I watch options trading course recordings if I miss live sessions?",answer:{summary:"Lifetime access to all recordings! Our online options trading course ensures you never miss important content.","Recording benefits":["All live sessions uploaded within 2-4 hours","Lifetime access to entire video library"],note:"Never worry about missing a live options trading session again."}},{question:"What if I miss a live options trading session - how do I catch up?",answer:{summary:"Multiple ways to stay current with our options trading course online.","Immediate catch-up options":["Watch session recordings - Available within 2-4 hours with full audio/video","Community Q&A - Ask questions about missed content in our private group","Weekly AMA sessions - Get answers to specific questions from instructors","Peer support - Connect with other students who attended the session"],note:"Our best options trading course structure ensures you're never left behind."}},{question:"How much time should I dedicate to this options trading course?",answer:{summary:"Flexible 3-4 hours weekly commitment designed for busy professionals.","Time breakdown":["1-2 hours: Live weekend sessions or recordings","1 hour: Practice","30-60 minutes: Community participation and Q&A","Optional: Additional practice time for faster progress"],"Flexible scheduling":["Self-paced video modules","Weekend-focused live sessions","Mobile-friendly platform for learning on-the-go","Lifetime access means no rushing through content"],note:"This options trading course for working professionals respects your time while delivering results."}},{question:"Is this really the best options trading course for beginners?",answer:{summary:"Our results speak for themselves! Here's why students consistently rate us as the top options trading course:","What makes us different":["Live trading sessions","Personalized feedback on your trades","Community of successful options traders","Lifetime support and course updates"],note:"Join the best options trading course online and see why we're consistently rated #1."}}],offerings:e=>["<strong>Professional Algo Trading Course</strong> (includes both Option buying and Selling)","Lifetime access to our <strong>Exclusive community</strong> to discuss strategies and get expert opinions.",`<strong>${e} Credits</strong> (Can be used for Backtest, Forward Test and Algo Trade).`,"<strong>Weekly classes</strong> and Q&A sessions"],testimonials:[{name:"Guru Mahto",parts:[{text:"Explained nicely in an ",highlight:!1},{text:"interactive",highlight:!0},{text:" manner.",highlight:!1}]},{name:"Mithil Khunt",parts:[{text:"Very good explanation and learning about ",highlight:!1},{text:"algo trading from scratch.",highlight:!0},{text:" Very well explained how to build strategies using algotest.",highlight:!1}]},{name:"Sumit Joshi",parts:[{text:"Very practical ",highlight:!1},{text:"systematic approach.",highlight:!0}]},{name:"Kamalesh Agarwal",parts:[{text:"Very systematic, ",highlight:!1},{text:"elaborate and methodical.",highlight:!0}]}]},{_id:"raghav-vol-course",product_id:"discretionary-course",image:"/course/course-raghav.png",link_id:"volatility",videoId:"clZrctNuZxI",videoLink:"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1115132370?title=0&byline=0&portrait=0&badge=0&autopause=0&player_id=0&app_id=58479&autoplay=1&muted=0",duration:"8-10 weeks",status:"Batch Starting Soon!",title:"Volatility Trading Course: Trade Options the Institutional Way",description:"Retail traders chase price. Institutions trade volatility. Learn how to use Implied Volatility (IV), Realized Volatility (RV), and the Volatility Risk Premium (VRP) to decide when to buy and when to sell options, like a pro.",reminder:"Remember: All option trading is volatility trading, whether you know it or not.",instructor:"Raghav Malik",features:e=>[{icon:"Users",text:"Exclusive Community"},{icon:"Code",text:`${e} Credits`},{icon:"Calendar",text:"Weekly Classes"},{icon:"GraduationCap",text:"Volatility Trading Course"}],curriculum:[{module:"Module 1",title:"Edge, Position Sizing & Skew",description:["Learn what edge really means (expected value > 0) and why most traders lose by running zero-edge systems after costs.\nUnderstand that positive edge ≠ profit on every trade, poor bet sizing can still lead to ruin.\nGet a practical intro to Kelly (fractional) sizing and explore how skew and tail risks shape real-world P&L curves"]},{module:"Module 2",title:"Implied Volatility (IV) Made Intuitive",description:["See options pricing as a function (Black–Scholes) and grasp why payoffs are convex, small price moves create big changes.\nUnderstand implied volatility as the market’s forecast of future variability, backed out from option prices.\nLearn to annualize and compare IV across strikes and expiries using the √time rule for consistent analysis."]},{module:"Module 3",title:"Put–Call Parity (and Why Call & Put IV Must Match)",description:["Learn put–call parity: (C + K = P + F), a no-arbitrage law that keeps call and put prices aligned.\nSee how deviations create synthetic arbitrage opportunities and why this ensures parity in IVs.\nApply parity practically, close illiquid deep ITM options or replicate synthetic longs and shorts efficiently."]},{module:"Module 4",title:"Realized Volatility (RV) and Market Reality",description:["Understand realized volatility (RV) as the true movement of prices compared to what was implied before the fact.\nMeasure RV from historical returns and study how the IV–RV spread defines volatility mispricing.\nUse RV tracking to validate models, spot opportunities, and ground volatility trading in data."]},{module:"Module 5",title:"Volatility Risk Premium (VRP): From Theory to Trade",description:["Discover why options are structurally overpriced (IV > RV) and how sellers earn the volatility risk premium.\nLearn the difference between inefficiency and risk premium, and why most option profits come from the latter.\nMaster the VRP trade logic, sell volatility prudently, manage risk, and size conservatively for long-term survival."]},{module:"Module 6",title:"Variance, Greeks & Delta-Neutral Risk",description:["See why variance in P&L can erase even positive-edge systems and how delta exposure worsens it.\nUse Greeks to identify what risks actually pay, VRP rewards volatility exposure, not direction.\nAdopt delta-neutral frameworks like straddles or hedging to smooth returns and capture the true VRP edge."]},{module:"Module 7",title:"Greeks & Option Risk",description:["Break down each Greek’s role in option risk, Delta (direction), Gamma (convexity), Theta (time decay), Vega (IV sensitivity).\nLearn how expiry choice changes exposure, longer-dated options amplify Vega but calm Gamma/Theta.\nUnderstand how traders balance these forces to retain only profitable risk and discard variance that doesn’t pay."]},{module:"Module 8",title:"Spotting & Structuring VRP Trades",description:["Identify when VRP exists using the IV–RV spread across weekly, monthly, and multi-month maturities.\nAvoid forced trades in low-VRP regimes, edge must justify variance and effort.\nDesign delta-neutral, risk-defined setups like straddles, strangles, or iron condors to systematically harvest VRP."]}],faqs:[{question:"Is this beginner-friendly if I only know calls/puts?",answer:{note:"",summary:"Yes. We start with IV/RV from first principles and build up to VRP, buy/sell rules, and risk. You need only basic options familiarity and willingness to learn."}},{question:"Do I get live sessions and community access?",answer:{note:"",summary:"*Absolutely.* - *Weekly live sessions* with Raghav (Q&A included) - *Lifetime access* to a *private Discord* of serious traders - Session schedules are posted inside the community"}},{question:"Are recordings provided?",answer:{note:"",summary:"Yes! Recordings are *shared* in the community on the discord*.* - Attend the next live session (they’re weekly) - Ask in the community for recaps and resources"}},{question:"Is this for option buyers or sellers?",answer:{note:"",summary:"*Both, but with a volatility lens.*- When *IV is cheap* (relative to expected RV): frameworks for *buying* convexity.- When *IV is rich* (positive VRP): frameworks for *selling* premium (with risk controls)."}},{question:"How much time do I need each week?",answer:{note:"",summary:"Plan *3–4 hours/week*:- 1–2 hours live session- 1 hour practice (Strategy Builder / Monte Carlo)- 30–60 minutes discussion in the community"}},{question:"What’s included in the fee?",answer:{note:"",summary:"- *Weekly live sessions* (ongoing)- *Lifetime Community Access*- *7,500 AlgoTest credits*"}},{question:"Do I need advanced math?",answer:{note:"",summary:"No. You’ll get intuitive explanations first, formulas second. We use visuals, examples on NIFTY/BANKNIFTY, and pre-built tools to keep it practical."}},{question:"How do I enroll?",answer:{note:"",summary:"Click Enroll Now, complete payment (₹9,999 + GST), and you’ll immediately receive the next steps to join the community."}}],offerings:e=>["<strong>Volatility Trading Course</strong>: Trade Options the Institutional Way (IV, RV & VRP)","Lifetime access to our <strong>Exclusive community</strong> to discuss strategies and get expert opinions.",`<strong>${e} Credits</strong> (Can be used for Strategy Builder, Historical Simulator & Algo Trade).`,"<strong>Weekly classes</strong> and Q&A sessions"],testimonials:[{name:"Varun Goyal",parts:[{highlight:!1,text:"I think this is an excellent program. No such offering exists in the market. I really wish you extend and scale this further. Listening to Raghav is such a pleasure."}]},{name:"Jocky",parts:[{highlight:!1,text:"Came to know a few new concepts and it's clearly explained and very informative."}]},{name:"Hemant Basna",parts:[{highlight:!1,text:"Excellent Course"}]},{name:"Hardik",parts:[{highlight:!1,text:"I think the course throws light on a lot of theoretical insights on options as a trading tool and how the various parameters such as delta, gamma, vega theta and IV can be used to inherently generate profits from options, good for beginners."}]}]}],upcomingCourses:[{image:"/course/astronaut.png",title:"Upcoming Course"}]}},50206:e=>{"use strict";e.exports={version:"1.0.35"}},50660:(e,t,r)=>{"use strict";r.d(t,{G:()=>s});var n=r(37876),i=r(67258),a=r(15039),o=r.n(a);let s=e=>{let{value:t,onChange:r,inputClassname:a,containerClassname:s,placeholder:l="Search"}=e;return(0,n.jsxs)("div",{className:o()("sticky  top-0 flex w-full  items-center gap-2 overflow-hidden border-b  border-primaryBlack-250  bg-primaryBlack-0 px-3 py-3 dark:border-[#2e2e2e]",s),children:[(0,n.jsx)(i.eSy,{className:"size-4 text-primaryBlack-700"}),(0,n.jsx)("input",{type:"text",placeholder:l,value:t,onChange:e=>r(e.target.value),className:o()("flex-1 border-0 px-0 py-0 text-xs text-primaryBlack-750 placeholder:text-xs placeholder:font-normal placeholder:text-primaryBlack-750 focus:outline-0 focus:!ring-0 dark:bg-primaryBlack-0",a)})]})}},50902:(e,t,r)=>{"use strict";r.d(t,{F:()=>n,h:()=>i});let n={Hour:9,Minute:35},i={Hour:15,Minute:15}},52496:(e,t,r)=>{"use strict";Object.defineProperty(t,"__esModule",{value:!0}),!function(e,t){for(var r in t)Object.defineProperty(e,r,{enumerable:!0,get:t[r]})}(t,{default:function(){return s},noSSR:function(){return o}});let n=r(64252);r(3787