t on any price level or indicator. Now in AlgoTest Signals you can connect this alert with Future/Option position. So if a alert is generated in TradingView, AlgoTest Signal will execute your Future/Option position on your broker terminal."},{q:"How many signals can I generate using this?",a:"There is no limit to create AlgoTest Signals and to execute them."},{q:"What is the advantage of using AlgoTest Signals?",a:(0,n.jsxs)("ul",{className:"list-inside list-disc",children:[(0,n.jsx)("li",{children:"AlgoTest's Signals gives you seamless and easy integration with TradingView. "}),(0,n.jsx)("li",{children:"Code-free solution for automation. "}),(0,n.jsx)("li",{children:"No need to create pinescripts! We provide them to you. "})]})}],er=[{q:"Can I backtest a TradingView strategy on AlgoTest using Signals Plan?",a:"Unfortunately, it is not possible to backtest a TradingView strategy on AlgoTest using Signals plan. You can perform a backtest of your strategy on TradingView on Underlying using PineScript."},{q:"Can I trade stocks and commodities using the AlgoTest Signals Plan?",a:"Currently, you can trade Index Futures & Options of NSE & BSE indices and Stocks Futures & Options of NSE using our Signals Plan."},{q:"Do I need to activate my strategy daily for live trading?",a:"No, you don't need to activate your strategy daily. However, you do need to login with your broker every morning. Once you have logged into your broker, we start listening."},{q:"Why was my trade executed in AlgoTest without any alert in TradingView?",a:"It is possible that you activated your strategy from the live trade/forward test page, please be cautious when triggering your trades."},{q:"Can I trade positional strategies using AlgoTest Signals Plan?",a:"Yes, you can trade positional strategies using AlgoTest Signals Plan."},{q:"Do I need to purchase a TradingView Premium plan to use Signals?",a:"You only need to purchase the minimum TradingView essential plan to use Signals."},{q:"How can I create an alert on multiple indicators?",a:"To create an alert on multiple indicators, you need to code your strategy in Pine Script. If you don’t know Pine Script, don’t worry. We provide Pine Script support for free in our 6-month Signals plan."},{q:"How many strategies can I deploy in the AlgoTest Signals Plan?",a:"You can deploy any number of strategies in AlgoTest Signals Plan."},{q:"Why is execution in forward testing delayed?",a:(0,n.jsxs)(n.Fragment,{children:["Execution in forward test is not delayed. It is just that it works on slightly delayed data, where your trades are displayed after candle close.",(0,n.jsx)("br",{}),(0,n.jsx)("br",{}),"DISCLAIMER ",(0,n.jsx)("br",{}),"As per NSE’s data usage policy, realtime data cannot be used for Paper trading. One reason for this is the possibility of using real time data for dabba trading, which is banned for obvious reasons – https://investor.sebi.gov.in/dabba_trading.html. This is why AlgoTest provides paper trading (forward testing), but on slightly delayed data, where your trades are displayed after candle close."]})},{q:"Will the AlgoTest Signal work if I turn off my internet connection?",a:(0,n.jsxs)(n.Fragment,{children:["Both AlgoTest Signal and TradingView alerts are hosted on cloud servers, and they will continue to function even if your mobile or laptop is switched off.",(0,n.jsx)("br",{}),"This is what makes algotrading uniquely safe for busy traders."]})}],en=[{name:"ADX Strategy",link:"/adx_strategy"},{name:"SuperTrend Strategy",link:"/supertrend_strategy"},{name:"RSI Strategy",link:"/rsi_strategy"},{name:"Bollinger Bands Strategy",link:"/bb_bands_strategy"},{name:"EMA MACD RSI Combined Strategy",link:"/ema_macd_rsi_combined_strategy"},{name:"MA Crossover Strategy",link:"/ma_crossover_strategy"},{name:"VWAP Strategy",link:"/vwap_strategy"},{name:"Fibonacci Retracement Strategy",link:"/fibonacci_retracement_strategy"},{name:"MACD Strategy",link:"/macd_strategy"},{name:"ATR Strategy",link:"/atr_strategy"},